    both chains; added OPUS/VIMS notes (opus=, opus_id=, vims_channel=);
    updated importer table (.qub), SEE ALSO, and REFERENCES.
  * p.in.rings.md: rewritten examples to use p.in.astropedia opus_id= for
    the raw image fetch (replaces r.in.gdal -o); added KDIR variable for
    readable kernel lists; added p.rings.stats as Step 6 of Chain A; both
    chains now labelled "← this module" at Step 4.
  * p.rings.project.md: updated Chain A Step 2 to use p.in.astropedia; added
    KDIR variable; added note that Chain B (polar) does not need this module;
    updated SEE ALSO.
  * p.rings.stats.md: added full Chain A pipeline context with all 6 steps,
    this module's step labelled; added note on using p.rings.project -i to
    compute radial profiles from polar (Chain B) output; updated SEE ALSO.
  * cassini_rev014_polar.sh: updated Step 1 description to reference
    p.spice.find; Step 2 now uses p.in.astropedia opus_id= (was r.in.gdal).

