grass-planetary-addons (0.8.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New module: p.in.lroc.nac — list and import LROC NAC DTMs (2–5 m
    site-specific stereo-derived lunar topography) from the ASU LROC PDS
    archive. Scrapes the NAC_DTM directory, parses each product's PDS4
