grass-planetary-addons (0.6.5) unstable; urgency=medium

  * p.crater.draw: implement sub-pixel centre and radius refinement
    (refine.c / refine.h).  A 7x7x7 grid search over ±r/3 in centre
    and ±15% in radius, maximising the standardised rim-vs-inner
    contrast score (rim_mean − inner_mean) / (rim_std + 0.5), is run
    on every DEM/merged candidate after NMS and before multi-ring
    aggregation.  Image-only candidates are left untouched.  Reduces
    the coarse-stride positional error from ~r/6 to ~r/18, making
    concentric-ring basin grouping (-m) reliable.
  * New flag -R to skip refinement and preserve raw coarse centres.
  * Testsuite: two new tests — test_norefine_flag_runs and
    test_subpixel_refinement_centre_accuracy (crater at offset origin,
    refined centre must land within 200 m of truth).
  * Manual: sub-pixel refinement moved from FUTURE WORK into NOTES;
    full algorithmic description added with tolerance guidance.

