    p.* binary's --interface-description at startup, parses the
    label and keywords via QXmlStreamReader, groups by keyword[1],
    and builds submenus in a deterministic order (kCategoryOrder).
    Bespoke Qt6 dialogs (GrassCraterDialog, GrassCraterDrawDialog,
    GrassCraterFreqDialog, GrassSpiceKernelDialog) are overlaid via
