grass-planetary-addons (0.5.6) unstable; urgency=medium

  * p.crater: new dd_simple= option lets the user override the per-body
    simple-crater depth/diameter ratio on any run (validated against
    (0, 0.5]; lunar canonical is 0.196). Applies to every crater in
    the run, propagating through both the simple regime and the
    simple-anchored complex-regime smooth transition. Useful for
    testing alternative scaling fits, working with bodies not in
    the database (with body=custom), and comparing published
    Robbins-style d/D values.
  * qtgrass 0.4.9: GrassCraterDialog "Custom body" tab grows a new
    "Simple-crater d/D (override)" QDoubleSpinBox - value 0 means
    "use body default", any positive value emits dd_simple= on the
    QProcess argv.
  * p.crater.md: new "Overriding the d/D per run" subsection of the
    DEPTH/DIAMETER RATIO PER BODY section with a Mars + Robbins-style
    0.165 example.

