grass-planetary-addons (0.5.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Minor bump per the single-digit-patch convention (0.4.9 -> 0.5.0).
  * p.crater.freq: accept crater diameters from EITHER a CSV file (default)
    OR a designated column of a GRASS vector attribute table (typically
    the Df_pi column produced by p.crater). New options:
      - vector=  optional, takes a vector map name
      - column=  required when vector= is set, names the diameter
                 attribute (auto-detects metres vs km from value range)
      - layer=   layer number for vector, defaults to 1
    The two sources are mutually exclusive; exactly one must be given.
    Module now links VECTORLIB + DBMILIB and reads via the dbmi API.
  * p.crater.freq: -h flag renamed to -t (Hartmann mode), since -h is
    reserved by GRASS for --help.
  * p.crater.freq.md updated with both CSV and vector usage examples.
  * qtgrass 0.4.9 ships matching bespoke Qt6 dialogs:
      - GrassCraterDialog       (5-tab form: Geometry/Body, Impactor,
        Geology two-layer + DEM, Custom body overrides, Run log;
        built-in body picker with 48 entries; QProcess-driven run with
        live output streaming)
      - GrassCraterFreqDialog   (source toggle between CSV file picker
        and vector+column dropdowns; analysis params; live run log)
    A new "Crater Analysis" submenu is added to the Planetary menu,
    sitting between Mosaic and Utilities. p.crater.freq is moved out of
    Utilities into the new submenu alongside p.crater.

