grass-planetary-addons (0.4.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian package for Planetary Bridge project
  * 27 GRASS addon modules across 5 categories:
    - I/O: p.in.pds3, p.in.pds4, p.in.isis, p.out.isis, p.spiceinit
    - Photometric: p.phocube, p.photomet, p.photrim, p.albedo, p.atcorr.hapke
    - Geometry: p.cam2map, p.caminfo, p.dem.prep, p.slope.planet, p.shadow.planet
    - Spectral: p.spectral.planet, p.mineral.indices, p.specpix, p.dstripe,
      p.desmear, p.cubenorm, p.bandnorm
    - Rings: p.rings.project, p.rings.stats, p.crater.freq, p.target.info, p.automos
  * 7 fundamental C libraries with comprehensive documentation:
    - p_pds: PDS3/PDS4 label parsing and image I/O
    - p_photomodel: 7 photometric models (Hapke, Minnaert, Lunar-Lambert, etc.)
    - p_atmosmodel: 4 atmospheric radiative transfer models
    - p_shapemodel: Ellipsoid, DEM, plane ray-surface intersections
    - p_projection_planet: Ring and high-latitude map projections
    - p_spectra: Band depth, continuum removal, SAM analysis
    - p_spice: NAIF CSPICE geometry toolkit wrapper
  * All modules include gunittest test suites and .md manuals with
    scientific references

